cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this software, please cite the exact software version or commit
  and the associated physics publication.
title: cuprates-transport
abstract: >-
  A Python package for semiclassical Boltzmann transport calculations using
  the Chambers formula, with support for general tight-binding dispersions,
  anisotropic scattering, magnetic-field transport, and ADMR.
version: 0.7.0
authors:
  - family-names: Grissonnanche
    given-names: Gael
repository-code: https://github.com/gaelgrissonnanche/cuprates_transport
license: GPL-3.0-only
keywords:
  - Boltzmann transport
  - Chambers formula
  - condensed matter physics
  - Fermi surface
  - magnetoresistance
  - angle-dependent magnetoresistance
